  journalLore: A knee-high scrap of root and moss that has learned to walk. They are not very clever, and Liv thinks there may be only one of them, in a sense.
  journalAdvice: One is nothing, but they are never one. Don't let them gather around you, and if something is calling them up, go for it first.
  journalHabitat: Anywhere the roots are near the surface, usually several at once
